{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicSectionMoving",
    "description": "MOSAIC's transfer of particles between size sections as they grow by condensation or shrink by evaporation (WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_movesect.F, subroutine move_sections with msectional = 20: move_sections_initial_conform, move_sections_calc_masnumadvect, move_sections_apply_moves), written as what it discretizes: the condensational-growth advection of the number distribution in particle volume, dn/dt + d(G n)/dv = 0. Each section j of each level carries its number num[lev,bin] and the volume-carried quantities q[lev,bin,trc] (the ten MOSAIC components, then the hysteresis water and the aerosol water, rsub's own rows in its own units), and grows by condensation at the dry-volume rate dvdt[lev,bin]. MOSAIC shares a section's condensed volume over its particles in proportion to their volume (the whole section is scaled by one factor), so the growth law within section j is G(v) = lam_j v with lam_j = dvdt_j / vdry_j, the section's relative volume growth rate. The number and every q then obey dnum/dt = -D(lam*num, vdry, wrt: bin) and dq/dt = -D(lam*q, num, vdry, wrt: bin), the integrated growth divergence over each section; both are lowered by the EarthSciDiscretizations rules grids/sectional_volume_1d/rules/growth_lr2m_D_bin_closed and growth_lr2m_tracer_D_bin_closed, which hold MOSAIC's two-moment linear reconstruction, the upwind edge flux and the closed size range. These are the dt -> 0 limit of MOSAIC's fully discrete remap, measured, not assumed: the tests' references are a real64 replay of WRF's own move_sections on the state recorded at its entry, with the step's growth scaled down to fractions 1e-2 and 2e-2, the composition held at its pre-growth value, and Richardson-extrapolated (data/eqwefic/notes/chem170_mosaic_movesect_capture.md). WHAT IS NOT HERE, and why. (1) The condensation itself (the lam V growth of each section's own volume) is ASTEM's rate, not this operator: this component is only the transfer between sections. (2) MOSAIC's finite-step relocations are projections, not rates: a section whose mean volume has left its edges is moved whole to the section holding the mean ('moving center', iforce_movecenter 2, 3, 12, 13), and the number of an empty or no_aerosol section is reset so its mean lies within its edges (the initial and final conforms). At an infinitesimal step neither moves anything, so they contribute nothing here; how often a step needs them is recorded in the capture note. (3) A section whose dry mass is at or below smallmassaa, or whose dry density lies outside [dens_min, dens_max] (MOSAIC writes -1 for its no_aerosol state), does not move (lam = 0): MOSAIC's iforce_movecenter 1 and 11.",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "created": "2026-11-12T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": [
      "mosaic",
      "aerosol",
      "section moving",
      "condensational growth",
      "wrf-chem"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R. A., Easter, R. C., Fast, J. D., & Peters, L. K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). Journal of Geophysical Research, 113, D13204.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2007JD008782"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Gelbard, F., Tambour, Y., & Seinfeld, J. H. (1980). Sectional representations for simulating aerosol dynamics. Journal of Colloid and Interface Science, 76(2), 541-556.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9797(80)90394-X"
      }
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 59,
      "description": "Number of grid cells (levels), each with its own size distribution."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 8,
      "description": "Number of MOSAIC size sections (8 for chem_opt = 170)."
    },
    "NTRC": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 12,
      "description": "Number of volume-carried quantities per section: MOSAIC's ten aerosol components (ncomp_plustracer_aer), then the hysteresis water, then the aerosol water, in move_sections' rmassxx order."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "bin_nodes": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "NBIN",
          1
        ]
      }
    },
    "trc": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NTRC"
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "MosaicSectionMoving": {
      "subsystems": {
        "par": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_movesect_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/sectional_volume_1d/rules/growth_lr2m_D_bin_closed.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NCELL": "NLEV",
            "NBIN": "NBIN"
          },
          "rename": {
            "cell": "lev"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/sectional_volume_1d/rules/growth_lr2m_tracer_D_bin_closed.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NCELL": "NLEV",
            "NBIN": "NBIN",
            "NTRACER": "NTRC"
          },
          "rename": {
            "cell": "lev",
            "tracer": "trc"
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "vb": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "bin_nodes"
          ],
          "default": [3.1208925632862246e-17, 2.4967140506289797e-16, 1.9973712405031837e-15, 1.597896992402547e-14, 1.2783175939220376e-13, 1.02265407513763e-12, 8.18123260110104e-12, 6.544986080880832e-11, 5.235988864704666e-10],
          "description": "Section edge volumes, single-particle dry volume in cm3: MOSAIC's volumlo_sect(1..NBIN) then volumhi_sect(NBIN) (pi/6 d^3 of the section edge diameters, 0.039 to 10 um doubling, as WRF's real32 values). Consecutive sections share an edge (volumhi_sect(j) = volumlo_sect(j+1) bit for bit in the dump)."
        },
        "num": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol^-1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 10000000000.0,
          "description": "Section number, particles per mol of air (rsub at numptr_aer)."
        },
        "q": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "trc"
          ],
          "default": 1e-12,
          "description": "Volume-carried quantities of each section, rsub's rows in rsub's units (mol per mol of air): the ten components at massptr_aer, then hyswptr_aer, then waterptr_aer. The operator is linear in q."
        },
        "drymass": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1e-12,
          "description": "Section dry mass, g per mol of air (MOSAIC's mass_dry_a / cair_mol_cc, move_sections' drymass)."
        },
        "drydens": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "g/cm^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 1.8,
          "description": "Section dry density, g/cm3 (MOSAIC's dens_dry_a; -1 for a section in its no_aerosol state)."
        },
        "dvdt": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "cm^3/(mol*s)",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Rate of change of the section's dry volume by condensation (positive) or evaporation (negative), cm3 of particle per mol of air per second -- the growth this operator redistributes."
        },
        "vdry": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "cm^3/mol",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Section dry volume, drymass/drydens (cm3 of particle per mol of air): the second moment the size-space reconstruction reads."
        },
        "lam": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s^-1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Relative volume growth rate of each section, dvdt/vdry, and zero for a section that does not move (dry mass at or below smallmassaa, or dry density outside [dens_min, dens_max])."
        },
        "dnum_dt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/(mol*s)",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ],
          "description": "Rate of change of the section number by transfer between sections."
        },
        "dq_dt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/s",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "trc"
          ],
          "description": "Rate of change of each volume-carried quantity by transfer between sections, mol per mol of air per second."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "vdry",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "j"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "drymass",
                    "k",
                    "j"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "drydens",
                    "k",
                    "j"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "lam",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "j"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "and",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "and",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": ">=",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "drydens",
                                "k",
                                "j"
                              ]
                            },
                            "par.dens_min"
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "<=",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": [
                                "drydens",
                                "k",
                                "j"
                              ]
                            },
                            "par.dens_max"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": ">",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "drymass",
                            "k",
                            "j"
                          ]
                        },
                        "par.smallmassaa"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "dvdt",
                        "k",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": [
                        "vdry",
                        "k",
                        "j"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                0.0
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dnum_dt",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "D",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "lam",
                      "num"
                    ]
                  },
                  "vdry"
                ],
                "wrt": "bin"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dq_dt",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "D",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "lam",
                      "q"
                    ]
                  },
                  "num",
                  "vdry"
                ],
                "wrt": "bin"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "movesect_s1",
          "description": "Model step 1, the whole 59-level column x 8 sections. Reference: the em_scm_xy chem_opt = 170 column (data/eqwefic/chem170_scm, reference namelist unchanged), move_sections capture dumps/chem170_mosaic_movesect (WRF fork earthsciml-instrumented-chem170 711bb56a; bit-identical to dumps/chem170_mosaic_coag on all 5216 shared fields). Inputs are move_sections' own entry state: the PRE-growth section number and the twelve volume-carried rows (rsub_in: the ten components, the hysteresis water, the water), the pre-growth dry mass and density (drymass_pregrow, drydens_pregrow) and the step's dry-volume growth rate dvdt = (drymass_aftgrow/drydens_aftgrow - drymass_pregrow/drydens_pregrow)/dtchem. Expected values: the dt -> 0 limit of WRF's own move_sections, from the REAL64 replay (wrf-chem170/kernels/movesect_driver, chem170_scm/movesect64) with the step's growth scaled to the fractions 1e-2 and 2e-2 and the rows held at their pre-growth values (ESM_MS_FREEZE=1), Richardson-extrapolated. Real64 because WRF's real32 call forms each transferred fraction as 1 minus a number close to 1 (FORTRAN_BUGS N125). Tolerance measured over all 16 capture steps (98,176 entries), not assumed: every entry within rel 1e-5 or 1e-6 of the largest rate of its quantity in the step (worst 0.13 of that bound); the bound is set by the replay's own round-off and O(delta^2) truncation, not by the operator.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "num": [[915488.3125, 616091.5625, 380046.875, 117452.640625, 15366.806640625, 1091.6971435546875, 109.3515625, 11.856562614440918], [920493.25, 619459.8125, 382124.65625, 118094.765625, 15450.818359375, 1097.66552734375, 109.94939422607422, 11.921382904052734], [925741.3125, 622991.5625, 384303.25, 118768.0546875, 15538.908203125, 1103.923583984375, 110.57624816894531, 11.989350318908691], [931234.1875, 626688.0625, 386583.53125, 119472.7734375, 15631.1083984375, 1110.4737548828125, 111.23235321044922, 12.060487747192383], [936980.25, 630554.9375, 388968.8125, 120209.9609375, 15727.5576171875, 1117.32568359375, 111.91869354248047, 12.134904861450195], [942968.75, 634584.9375, 391454.84375, 120978.2421875, 15828.0751953125, 1124.4669189453125, 112.63399505615234, 12.21246337890625], [949239.3125, 638804.8125, 394057.9375, 121782.734375, 15933.3291015625, 1131.9444580078125, 113.38298797607422, 12.293672561645508], [955777.8125, 643205.0, 396772.28125, 122621.6015625, 16043.0810546875, 1139.741455078125, 114.16399383544922, 12.378355026245117], [962609.9375, 647802.8125, 399608.53125, 123498.1171875, 16157.7607421875, 1147.888427734375, 114.98004913330078, 12.466837882995605], [969754.625, 652610.9375, 402574.5, 124414.7578125, 16277.6875, 1156.408447265625, 115.83346557617188, 12.559369087219238], [977218.375, 657633.8125, 405672.90625, 125372.3203125, 16402.96875, 1165.308837890625, 116.72499084472656, 12.656033515930176], [985025.875, 662888.0, 408914.0625, 126373.9921875, 16534.021484375, 1174.6190185546875, 117.6575698852539, 12.757148742675781], [993201.6875, 668389.9375, 412308.0625, 127422.890625, 16671.25390625, 1184.368408203125, 118.6341323852539, 12.863033294677734], [1001679.25, 674095.125, 415827.40625, 128510.5234375, 16813.5546875, 1194.477783203125, 119.64674377441406, 12.972827911376953], [1010477.6875, 680016.1875, 419479.90625, 129639.328125, 16961.240234375, 1204.9697265625, 120.69770050048828, 13.086777687072754], [1019676.25, 686206